Source: mpvpaper-dde
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: arthas <arthas@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gcc, libwayland-bin, wayland-protocols
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mpvpaper-dde
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, socat, python3, python3-pyqt5
Suggests: deepin-livewallpaper-campfire-camping-in-the-forest
Description: video wallpaper for the deepin V25 / UOS 25 (Treeland) desktop
 mpvpaper engine (upstream GhostNaN/mpvpaper, vendored unmodified and
 rebuilt here) plus a DDE integration layer: a launcher driven by a user
 config, a watch hook that takes over the official wallpaper value when it
 points to a video (and yields the desktop for static images), and a PyQt5
 control panel.
 .
 Why: the V25 desktop session has no working official live-wallpaper path
 (control center only previews, never sets), and the lock-screen renderer
 consumes the same wallpaper key (a video value makes it go black). The
 watch hook rewrites a static placeholder into the official value while
 playing, so the lock screen stays safe.
 .
 Activate after install:
 systemctl --user daemon-reload &&
 systemctl --user enable --now mpvpaper-wallpaper.service
 mpvpaper-wallpaper-watch.service
 .
 Video files are NOT shipped; point VIDEO= in
 ~/.config/mpvpaper-wallpaper.conf to your own (system live wallpapers
 live in /usr/share/wallpapers/deepin-livewallpapers/). Without a user
 config the packaged default in /usr/share/mpvpaper-dde/ is used.
